  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Resekostnader till Moldavien f&#xF6;r Sten Str&#xF6;m, Sida. Bes&#xF6;ket ber&#xE4;knas till tre dagar under november, 1999. Insatsen skall resultera i ett projektf&#xF6;rslag f&#xF6;r fortsatt st&#xF6;d till Court of Accounts, Moldavien. Tidigare st&#xF6;d till Court of Account, &#xD6;st 50/1997, avslutades under v&#xE5;ren 1999.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sten Str&#xF6;m, Sida will travel to Moldava during three days. The aim is to develop a project-proposal for further support to the Court of Accounts in Moldova. Former support to the Court of Account  (50/1997), ended in 1999.</narrative>
  </description>
